// Desert Treasure - combat stat blocks (Corey, 2026-09-07).
//
// Every npc below was MOVED here out of content/scripts/_unpack/377/all.npc rather than copied -
// redeclaring a name that still exists there is a hard "Duplicate config found" build error. The
// same migration pattern quest_horror_combat.npc and areas/area_waterbirth/configs/
// dagannoth_kings.npc already use. Everything from "op2=Attack" (or vislevel, where op2 comes
// first) upward is the untouched raw cache appearance data; everything below it is new.
//
// This cache has NO combat data for Desert Treasure at all. Not one boss, mummy or scarab carried
// hitpoints, attack, strength, defence, respawnrate or a single combat param - the only Desert
// Treasure npcs with stats in the whole dump are the two Bandit Camp bandits. So the maps, models,
// animations and varbits were all built and shipped, and the fights were never wired. All numbers
// below are the OSRS values (the closest verifiable proxy for 2005 - no source records a
// 2005-specific figure that differs) with two adjustments explained inline.
//
// strengthbonus is chosen to land the documented max hit through this engine's own formula,
// ~npc_melee_maxhit:  maxhit = floor(((strength + 9) * (strengthbonus + 64) + 320) / 640)
// so the numbers are derived, not guessed. Each one is shown in a comment.

// ================================================================================ Kamil (ice)
// OSRS: level 154, 130 hp, 190/80/135, +60 att +100 str, def 35 stab / 60 slash / 35 crush / 0 magic.
// max hit 23 melee: ((80+9) * (100+64) + 320) / 640 = 23.
// Kamil's defining mechanic - immune to every spell except fire - is enforced in dt_ice.rs2, not
// here; there is no config flag for elemental immunity.
[icediamond_icewarrior]
name=Kamil
desc=Ice warrior.
model1=obj_khazard_helmet_manwear
model2=obj_iron_platelegs_manwear
model3=idk_man_jaw_medium
model4=obj_iron_platebody_manwear2
