// ================================================================================ Fareed (smoke)
// OSRS: level 167, 130 hp, 190/120/135, +0 att +120 str, melee def +100 across the board.
// max hit 40 melee needs strengthbonus 132 through this engine's formula, not the wiki's 120:
// ((120+9) * (132+64) + 320) / 640 = 40. With the wiki's +120 it would come out at 37, which is
// coincidentally the ice-gloves figure - so the two are easy to confuse. 40 is the real one.
// The disarm-without-ice-gloves and water-spells-only rules are in dt_smoke.rs2.
[firediamond_firewarrior]
